t-medium whitespace-nowrap sticky left-0 z-10 text-left" style="background-color: rgb(49, 70, 102);">Ano</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-right">Receita</th><th scope="col" class="px-3 py-2 font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-right"><span title="Lucro líquido descontado: o lucro sem itens não recorrentes." data-explicacao-coluna="lucro" class="cursor-help">Lucro líquido<span class="sr-only">: Lucro líquido descontado: o lucro sem itens não recorrentes.</span></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-b border-gray-100 last:border-b-0 dark:border-gray-800" data-ultimo-ano="true"><th scope="row" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs sticky left-0 z-[1] text-left font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90 bg-white dark:bg-[#1F1F22] shadow-[inset_0_0_0_999px_rgba(0,121,242,0.06)] dark:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_999px_rgba(0,121,242,0.16)]">2025<span class="sr-only"> (último ano fiscal fechado)</span></th><td class="px-3 py-2 text-xs text-right tabular-nums bg-[#0079F2]/[0.06] dark:bg-[#0079F2]/[0.16] font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90  ">40.000</td><td class="px-3 py-2 text-xs text-right tabular-nums bg-[#0079F2]/[0.06] dark:bg-[#0079F2]/[0.16] font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90  ">6.400</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ul class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><li>Essencial: o que basta para acompanhar receita, lucro, caixa e dividendos ano a ano. Para abrir todos os demonstrativos, use o Raio-X.</li><li>Valores em R$ mi · ano fiscal · fonte: CVM</li><li data-nota-coluna="lucro">Lucro líquido: Lucro líquido descontado: o lucro sem itens não recorrentes.</li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby="valuation-WEGE3" class="min-w-0 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/[0.03] flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h2 id="valuation-WEGE3" class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 dark: