der-mf-seguranca bg-mf-seguranca text-white dark:border-mf-tranquilidade dark:bg-mf-tranquilidade/25 dark:text-white">Preço</button></div><p aria-live="polite" data-resumo-grupo="preco" class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-[13.5px] text-gray-700 dark:bg-white/[0.04] dark:text-gray-200">1 de 1 múltiplos acima da média de 10 anos<span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"> · marcador azul = valor atual · traço = média</span></p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr))]" data-grupo="preco"><div data-multiplo="pl" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-3 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h3 class="text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">P/L</h3><span class="text-lg font-semibold tabular-nums text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">27,1×</span></div><p class="text-[12.5px] text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Preço da ação dividido pelo lucro por ação dos últimos 12 meses.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">mediana de 4 pares: 18,2×</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-1" data-barra="visivel"><div role="meter" aria-label="P/L: Posição nos últimos 10 anos" aria-valuemin="22" aria-valuemax="40" aria-valuenow="27.1" aria-valuetext="mín 22,0×; média 25,0×; máx 40,0×; atual 27,1× · +8% vs. média 10a" class="relative mt-0.5 h-[22px]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-[9px] h-1 rounded-sm bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700"></span><span aria-hidden="true" style="left: 16.666666666666664%;" class="absolute top-1 h-3.5 w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 bg-gray-500 dark:bg-gray-400"></span><span aria-hidden="true" data-marcador="true" style="left: 28.333333333333343%;" class="absolute top-[3px] h-4 w-4 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-[#0079F2] shadow-[0_0_0_1px_#0079F2] dark:border-[#1F1F22] dark:bg-[#6E9DC4] dark:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_#6E9DC4]"></span></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="flex justify-between text-[11.5px] tabular-nums text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><span>mín 22,0×</span><span>média 25,0×</span><span>máx 40,0×</span></div><p class="text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">+8% vs. média 10a</p></div></div></div><ul class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"><li>Barra: mín, média (traço) e máx dos anos fiscais fechados; ponto = valor atual (12 meses). Descreve a posição do número, não diz se o preço está adequado.</li><li>Referência = mediana dos pares; barra = posição nos últimos 10 anos.</li></ul></section><div style="" class="grid min-w-0 gap-4 md:gap-6 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,2fr)]"><section aria-labelledby="historicos-WEGE3" class="min-w-0 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/[0.03] flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h2 id="historicos-WEGE3" class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">Múltiplos históricos</h2><span class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">ano fiscal · fonte CVM</span></div><div class="@container min-w-0"><div class="grid min-w-0 grid-cols-1 gap-4 @2xl:grid-cols-2"><figure class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">P/L histórico</h3><p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">histórico insuficiente para o gráfico</p></figure></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="pares-WEGE3" class="min-w-0 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/[0.03] flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h2 id="pares-WEGE3" class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">Pares do segmento</h2><span class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">mesmo segmento B3 (completado pelo subsetor)</span></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gr